WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.180
每天在職場與家庭中，我們都需要進行關鍵而艱難的對話。我想分享一套快速且高效的四步模型：ROOM 模型。

2
00:00:05.180 --> 00:00:10.300
Recognize（辨識）、Use（運用）、Understand（理解）與 Manage（管理）——這完全關乎情緒智慧。

3
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:17.920
第一步是辨識（Recognize）：我現在感受如何？對方當下的感受又是什麼？

4
00:00:17.920 --> 00:00:25.040
第二步是運用（Use）：評估情緒對思維與行為的影響。例如，你覺察到自己心生怨懟與防衛，這會導致你在對話中封閉自己；

5
00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:31.900
第三步是理解（Understand）：探究這份情緒背後的成因，以及你希望情緒如何演變。換句話說，對話結束時你希望彼此帶著什麼樣的感受？

6
00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:38.020
第四步是管理（Manage）：思考在對話中需要採取什麼行動來達成理想的情感結果？是創造傾聽的空間，還是保持沉默與同理？

7
00:00:38.020 --> 00:00:43.300
這套 ROOM 技能是高效溝通的基石。我們太常帶著被情緒鉤住的執念或死板技巧進入對話，

8
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:48.520
但決定對話成敗的真正關鍵，在於我們如何調度自己與對方的情感氛圍。

9
00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:54.460
about what is the cause of this emotion and also how do I want the emotion to

10
00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:59.500
play out over time. In other words, how do I at the end of the conversation want

11
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:04.180
to be feeling and how do I want the other person to be feeling? And then lastly

12
00:01:04.180 --> 00:01:10.300
is manage. Manage is about thinking what do you need to do in the conversation to

13
00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:15.460
get the emotional outcome that you need? Is it about creating space for

14
00:01:15.460 --> 00:01:21.940
conversation? Is it about listening and being quiet? What is it that is needed in

15
00:01:21.940 --> 00:01:28.500
order to get the outcome? This set of skills, this room model, I think, is

16
00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.860
foundational to effective conversations. Too often we go into conversations

17
00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:38.220
thinking about what I want to say in a way that feels really hooked on the

18
00:01:38.220 --> 00:01:44.340
difficulty motion or that's focused on facts and techniques. But what makes

19
00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:49.940
funny effect of conversation is how we manage the emotional tone of the

20
00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:54.940
conversation, both in ourselves and in the other person.
